OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment pledges to deport train
OL,4,Asex attackers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has pledged to deport
OL,7,Ftwo men convicted of carrying out a
OL,8,Fprolonged sexual attack on a lone
OL,9,F14-year-old girl on a train travelling
OL,10,Ffrom Kent.
OL,12,FAfghan nationals Baryalai Rahimi, 25,
OL,13,Fand Mirebadurahman Sadat, 29, were
OL,14,Ffound guilty of a string of sexual
OL,15,Foffences following the attack on the
OL,16,Fteenager in February.
OL,18,FThe pair are understood to have arrived
OL,19,Fin the UK by small boat in 2023, the
OL,20,FPress Association has reported.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
